		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Five-eyed, six-armed giant girded in golden plate mail, surrounded by nine levitating longswords. Second only to Asura Lords.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16 (+1 plate mail), <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 9 longsword (far) +6 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 2d6 HP on its turn.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sword-Master</strong>. Hovering longswords fly like spears, then return to asura. Trade 2 longsword attacks next round to deflect an attack that would hit.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
